\section*{Impact Statement}

This paper presents work whose goal is to advance the field of machine learning, specifically with regards to improving the quality of methods used to create and analyze human baselines in AI evaluation. We hope that by discussing methodological considerations in human baselining---and by highlighting shortcomings in existing baselining methods---our work will lead to rigorous AI evaluations that can be useful to not just the research community but also to users of AI systems and policymakers. We discuss broader implications of human baselines in Section \ref{sec:Intro}, and we do not anticipate any particular negative impacts associated with our work.

