Our experiments aim to address the following hypotheses:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{H1:} CRED generates queries with higher information gain than those generated by baselines.
    \item \textbf{H2:} CRED learns more accurate rewards with fewer iterations compared to baselines.
