We consider a mass $m$ of nonatomic agents where each agent chooses from a set $A=\{1,2,\ldots,n\}$ of \emph{actions}, with $n\ge2$. 
Action $i\in A$ takes $\tau_i$ time units to complete and {\em after that time} a reward $r_i$ is accrued to the acting agent. 
