\subsection{Democratization of 3D Model Creation}

Our research significantly democratizes 3D model creation, making it accessible to a wider audience. This fosters creativity and innovation, enabling individuals and small businesses to use AR without extensive technical expertise or resources. By empowering users to explore new ideas and applications, we break down barriers and broaden the scope of AR technologies, encouraging widespread adoption across various sectors.


