\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.7\linewidth]{sfc_plot.png}    \caption{Visualization of the space-filling curve at each tree level. Data points are uniformly sampled from the square \( [-1, 1] \times [-1, 1] \). Each subplot corresponds to a level of the partition tree. The title of each subplot indicates the tree level. The colors and the indices \( 1, 2, 3, \ldots \) denote the left-to-right ordering of the nodes at that level. The yellow line connects the nodes according to the space-filling curve traversal.}
