\section*{Broader Impact Statement}

\textbf{\our} contributes to the responsible development and deployment of language models by providing transparent evaluation of fundamental reasoning capabilities. By identifying models that achieve high accuracy without excessive computational overhead, our framework supports more sustainable AI deployment practices. The tool's ability to detect overthinking behavior can help researchers develop more efficient reasoning approaches, potentially reducing the environmental impact of large-scale model inference. For researchers, \textbf{\our} enables informed model selection based on accuracy-efficiency tradeoffs, promoting cost-effective deployment in resource-constrained environments. The open-source nature of our tool democratizes access to comprehensive LLM evaluation, supporting broader participation in AI research and development across academic and industry settings.

